 video-editing trends, viral formats, AI video tools, new content styles, editing technologies and industry best practices, and implement them to improve efficiency and output quality. Handle multiple projects simultaneously and deliver quality work within tight deadlines. Requirements 2127 years old. 1\u20138 years of work experience in an art/design or video-editing environment, preferably with an advertising agency (ATL/digital), brand or startup. Strong command of Adobe Premiere Pro and After Effects . Proficiency in CapCut or similar editing software . Experience with Final Cut is an advantage. Hands-on experience with AI tools for video creation, editing and content production. Proficiency in Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator and CorelDRAW. Good understanding of Telugu language and Telugu meme culture. Good awareness of Telangana, Andhra Pradesh and national politics. Strong understanding of short-form video, audience retention and current content trends. Strong sense of timing, humour, visual storytelling, music and aesthetics. Ability to create engaging content from raw footage, scripts and basic creative briefs. Ability to translate a brief into well-crafted communication content. Familiarity with special effects, animation, 3D and compositing. Keen eye for aesthetics, visual quality and attention to detail. Solid knowledge of design and visual principles. Creative mind with strong storytelling skills. Fast, creative and enthusiastic, with the ability to work effectively in a fast-paced environment and under pressure. Strong multitasking skills and the ability to work methodically and meet deadlines. Previous experience in political, meme, news or social media video editing is a plus. Should have experience creating posts, ads or banners for social media in a previous role. Editing machine/desktop is mandatory. P.S. This is a contractual role till June 2027.\n\nKey Skills: Video Editing,Telugu,Video,Editing"},{"title":"Vice President","company":"HR Footprints","